{"id":"n57774-1-7","stage":4,"title":"뭉클하다 · 心头一热","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57774-1-7-1","ko":"이 그림은 정말 감동적이네요.","zh":"这幅画真是令人感动啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"그림은","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림은","audio":"/audio/1d6abc0ee806f397935d.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"감동적이네요.","meaning":"感人的，动人的","explanation":"감동적：感人的，动人的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"감동적","audio":"/audio/b5ac8c4d76903cbd3069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15451","senseId":"1","lemma":"감동적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감동적이네요","audio":"/audio/46d3ade4edc337e6f079.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b5ac8c4d76903cbd","term":"감동적","zh":"感人的，动人的","audio":"/audio/b5ac8c4d76903cbd3069.mp3","entryId":"15451","definition":"有强烈感受后心动的。","pronunciation":["감ː동적"]}],"audio":"/audio/11b7e23cb5693d173000.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57774-1-7-2","ko":"나도 처음 봤을 때는 가슴이 뭉클했어요.","zh":"我第一次看到的时候，心里也觉得十分触动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}},{"text":"봤을","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤을","audio":"/audio/9e28017ad03dd90aaa23.mp3"}},{"text":"때는","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때는","audio":"/audio/2a0d00ce80f3166dc4a4.mp3"}},{"text":"가슴이","meaning":"心，心情，内心","explanation":"가슴：心，心情，内心；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가슴","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62908","senseId":"3","lemma":"가슴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가슴이","audio":"/audio/df6f423237a54255dcc1.mp3"}},{"text":"뭉클했어요.","meaning":"心头一热，感动，感慨","explanation":"뭉클하다：心头一热，感动，感慨；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭉클하다","audio":"/audio/03a4f3aa84b9a8ae0e51.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57774","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭉클하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭉클했어요","audio":"/audio/a49b5afb2de186ea7507.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"1bfa2a79f54c02d8","term":"가슴","zh":"心，心情，内心","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3","entryId":"62908","definition":"心理或感受。","pronunciation":["가슴"]},{"id":"03a4f3aa84b9a8ae","term":"뭉클하다","zh":"心头一热，感动，感慨","audio":"/audio/03a4f3aa84b9a8ae0e51.mp3","entryId":"57774","definition":"心里产生某种强烈的感情或感觉，心中充满了这些情感。","pronunciation":["뭉클하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fb16afa296c0a35d8133.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.413,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57774","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2397,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我第一次看到的时候，心里也觉得十分触动。","这幅画真是令人感动啊。","操场上的小石子真多。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这幅画真是令人感动啊。","操场上的小石子真多。","我第一次看到的时候，心里也觉得十分触动。"],"answer":2}]}
